  client: {fileID: 1534552363}
  goal: 'Both characters reach their own exits alive: player to exit_player, companion to exit_companion. The human controls player and gives no task commands. switch_a is a pressure switch: it opens door_a only while occupied. switch_b permanently latches door_a and door_b open when stepped on. Doors block both actors when closed. The gap before the exits can be crossed using the authored jump route. Infer useful cooperation from these rules and observed state.'
  eventDebounceSeconds: 0.2
  periodicDecisionSeconds: 0.5
